#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "For each wrong string: pick one of the candidates (its source is recorded with the suggestion) or type the text. The suggestion carries the text the reviewer saw (`current`), so a catalogue that changed under them is caught."
msgstr ""

#: library/processes/translation-review-adjudication.bpmn:102
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Joins the two branches: with or without seeding, the catalogue now goes on the page."
